  "coverage": [
    "An enclosing horizontal-block matrix comprehension may reuse its exact inner native scalar DAG when the inner selected U64 range has immutable constant endpoints, the inner row and its singleton transpose each have exactly one consumer, and the complete source CFG/capture/read inventories prove no escape or intervening effect. Selection uses no benchmark names, inputs or timings.",
    "The same Cranelift numeric-map emitter fills one final typed bank. The outer source index and inner induction word are derived from its admitted flat count. Checked scalar operations, branches, phi copies and independent matrix indices reuse the existing emitter and current immutable-owner views. Original row-block permutation, shape construction and atomic publication remain.",
    "The existing synchronous output loan now separately carries exact source count and output count. Preparation and completion check the same epoch, account, current source handle/storage, matrix owners, width, capacity, progress and complete initialization. Partial output is never published; a refused native attempt discards the bank and follows the original checked CFG.",
    "Both elided selected factories are checked with prepaid metadata scratch. The maintained range resolver certifies its cardinality and representation; both intermediate shapes are validated. Conservative bounds cover ordinary draft/finalization metadata, output, nodes, cloned bytes, comparison work, physical coexistence and complete fallback work. No source visit, helper callback or per-operation dispatch occurs in the native element body.",
    "The canonical transpose entry gate now admits exact matching Bool/U8/U16/U32/U64/I64/F64 rank-two matrices through the existing resident transpose kernel. No Core constructor or transpose arithmetic implementation changed.",
    "Five new original/decoded tests cover real rectangular entry and Object/restored descriptors, all seven scalar kinds including F64 bit patterns, conditional bodies, shapes, empty sources, fresh contents, immutable aliases, zero per-cell helpers, partial bounds/arithmetic failure, nine finite limit dimensions, exact current-loan corruption including source count, interleaving denial, atomic old outputs, cleanup and retry. Dynamic/ragged inner ranges retain the original path."
  ],
